Output examples/demo/out/file.gif

Set Shell bash
Set Width 1200
Set Height 560
Set FontSize 22
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Hide
Type "PS1='$ '"
Enter
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "./xylitol.sh file /"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s

Down
Sleep 400ms
Down
Sleep 400ms
Down
Sleep 400ms
Down
Sleep 400ms
Down
Sleep 900ms
Right
Sleep 1.2s
Left
Sleep 1.5s
